flowchart TD
    Query[User request]
    Model[ChatOllama model]
    Draft[Draft response]
    Critique[Same model returns SAFE or UNSAFE]
    Retry{Unsafe?}
    Rewrite[Ask same model to rewrite]
    Rules[Local Evaluator rules]
    Blocked[Replace with refusal text]
    Result[Return response]

    Query --> Model
    Model --> Draft
    Draft --> Critique
    Critique --> Retry
    Retry -->|Yes| Rewrite
    Rewrite --> Rules
    Retry -->|No| Rules
    Rules -->|Unsafe| Blocked
    Rules -->|Allowed| Result
    Blocked --> Result

    Attacks[Separate red-team prompt fixture]
    Attacks -.-> Query

    note1[Self-critique uses the same model; evaluator is rule based]
    note1 -.-> Critique
